{"id":3854,"date":"2023-08-23T11:34:55","date_gmt":"2023-08-23T10:34:55","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/?p=3854"},"modified":"2024-02-15T09:30:08","modified_gmt":"2024-02-15T09:30:08","slug":"ccacs-2023-26-co-design-expansion-programme-kicks-off","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/ccacs-2023-26-co-design-expansion-programme-kicks-off\/","title":{"rendered":"CCAC\u2019s 2023-26 co-design expansion programme kicks off!"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"588\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/co-design-expansion.jpg\" alt=\"CCAC\u2019s 2023-26 co-design expansion programme kicks off\" class=\"wp-image-3874 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/co-design-expansion.jpg 1200w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/co-design-expansion-300x147.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/co-design-expansion-1024x502.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/co-design-expansion-768x376.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/co-design-expansion-360x176.jpg 360w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/co-design-expansion-200x98.jpg 200w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1200px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1200\/588;\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Credit : Islington Tribune<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Designers from the Bristol office of global multidisciplinary design practice <a href=\"https:\/\/www.arup.com\/offices\/united-kingdom\/bristol\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Arup<\/a> will join Ashton Gate Primary School in 2024 to work with Year 5 on a transformational local infrastructure initiative set in extreme climate conditions of 2050.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/whapping-wharf.jpg\" alt=\"Wapping Wharf Phase I, Bristol \" class=\"wp-image-3875 lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1180px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1180\/576;width:1180px;height:576px\" width=\"1180\" height=\"576\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Wapping Wharf Phase I, Bristol a development of apartments and retail units combined with high-quality public realm.<br>Arup provided civil structural engineering, contaminated land assessment. and transport services<br>\u00a9 Arup 2023 All rights reserved<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Three architects from the Manchester office of <a href=\"https:\/\/www.levittbernstein.co.uk\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Levitt Bernstein<\/a> join Springfield Primary School, Sale from September 2023 to work with the students on concepts addressing the effects of climate extremes on the home, the street, and the community.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"700\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/Studio-Work.jpg\" alt=\"Levitt Bernstein - studio work in the Manchester office\" class=\"wp-image-3876 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/Studio-Work.jpg 1200w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/Studio-Work-300x175.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/Studio-Work-1024x597.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/Studio-Work-768x448.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/Studio-Work-343x200.jpg 343w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/Studio-Work-200x117.jpg 200w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1200px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1200\/700;\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Levitt Bernstein &#8211; studio work in the Manchester office<br>\u00a9 Levitt Bernstein 2023 All rights reserved<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Designers from <a href=\"https:\/\/www.zaha-hadid.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Zaha Hadid Architects<\/a>\u2019 London office will work on topics addressing the 2050 climate changed world with William Tyndale Primary School during spring 2024 and Thornhill Primary School in summer 2024.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1200\" height=\"480\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/chengdu-sf-museum.jpg\" alt=\"Chengdu Science fiction Museum currently under construction.\" class=\"wp-image-3877 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/chengdu-sf-museum.jpg 1200w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/chengdu-sf-museum-300x120.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/chengdu-sf-museum-1024x410.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/chengdu-sf-museum-768x307.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/chengdu-sf-museum-360x144.jpg 360w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/08\/chengdu-sf-museum-200x80.jpg 200w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1200px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 12